[00:31.06] You wait by the window
[00:55.66] Morning's breath on the sill
[00:58.95] Idle hands given another try
[01:03.21] So you wait and you savour the moment
[01:07.07] Outside the canvas turned white
[01:10.03] Ruby eyes in the fog
[01:14.09] Rain washing clean all the sins
[01:34.33] A liquid gown that covers all
[01:38.42] Your loathe turns endless
[01:42.07] Opened mirage soothes your sense
[01:46.99] Locked on the pinnacle
[01:49.40] The best secret within
[02:18.91] Like a derelict child
[02:47.72] Heart burning for a stranger
[02:53.42] Ascending to the meek
[02:57.20] Flock round the liars in awe
[03:08.89] Caked in the soil beneath
[03:40.66] Fear me when we meet
[03:44.46] Turn away in admiration
[03:48.34] My firm grip round the nucleus of joy
[04:10.01] Enough of this
[04:17.68] You will leave me now
[04:21.92] You will see it now
[04:24.32] Perish at my hands
[05:13.44] Close to you
[06:01.44] Tangled up in hair
[06:04.81] Fresh stigma looks
[06:08.45] Shall I take you with me
[06:11.78] And it is cold
[06:15.83] Ruby eyes in the fog
[06:19.06] It is me
[06:38.15] And you are just like them all
[06:52.09] Stained by the names of fathers
[06:56.12] I'm greeting my downward fall
[06:59.66] Leaving the throes to others
[07:09.67] 